  // 4) configure PIM for time-bound activation and MFA
  // 5) enable auditing and sandbox validation
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you test the rollback path to ensure no orphaned permissions remain?
- Which logs and alerts would you surface to security teams during the window?

## Why This Is Asked
This question probes basic yet practical CA, MFA, device compliance, auditing, and rollback thinking for Azure AD.

## Key Concepts
- Conditional Access
- Multifactor Authentication
- Device compliance
- Scoped app access
- Testing and rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example Graph API request to create a CA policy
const policy = {
  displayName: "MFA for SaaS App",
  state: "enabled",
  conditions: { apps: { includeApplications: ["<appId>"] }, users: { includeUsers: ["<groupId>"] } },
  grantControls: { operator: "OR", builtInControls: ["mfa"] }
};
fetch("https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/identity/conditionalAccess/policies", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: { "Authorization": `Bearer ${token}`, "Content-Type": "application/json" },
  body: JSON.stringify(policy)
});
```

## Follow-up Questions
- What would you do if legitimate access is blocked for a remote worker on a personal device?
- How would you measure CA policy impact and rollback safely without affecting other apps?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests knowledge of Azure AD B2B, group licensing, Conditional Access, and governance with Access Reviews. It also checks how candidates validate access during and after a time window.

## Key Concepts
- Azure AD B2B guest onboarding
- Group-based licensing
- Conditional Access MFA for guests
- Access Reviews and auto‑revocation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Graph API (pseudocode) invites a guest and adds to a guest group
async function inviteGuest(email) {
  await graphClient.api('/invitations').post({ invitedUserEmailAddress: email, inviteRedirectUrl: 'https://portal' });
  // add to guests group
  await graphClient.api(`/groups/{guestGroupId}/members/$ref`).post({ "@odata.id": `https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/users/${guestId}` });
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you handle license revocation if a guest leaves early?
- How would you monitor for guests with elevated access beyond 14 days?
